{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"registerSmsNumber:","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","text":"NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"number","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"number","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The phone number in E.164 international format.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Associates a phone number with the current device for SMS marketing campaigns."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"This enables omnichannel messaging where users can receive communications via"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"both push notifications and SMS."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The phone number must be in E.164 international format:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Start with ‘+’ followed by country code"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"No spaces, dashes, or parentheses","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Examples: “+14155551234” (US), “+447911123456” (UK), “+491711234567” (Germany)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Example","text":"Example","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Register SMS during phone verification flow:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["class PhoneVerificationController {","","    func verifyPhoneNumber(_ phoneNumber: String, code: String,","                          completion: @escaping (Result<Void, Error>) -> Void) {","","        APIClient.shared.verifyCode(phone: phoneNumber, code: code) { [weak self] result in","            switch result {","            case .success:","                let normalizedNumber = self?.normalizeToE164(phoneNumber) ?? phoneNumber","                Pushwoosh.configure.registerSmsNumber(normalizedNumber)","","                Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","                    \"phone_verified\": true,","                    \"sms_opted_in\": true,","                    \"phone_country\": self?.extractCountryCode(from: normalizedNumber) ?? \"\"","                ])","","                completion(.success(()))","","            case .failure(let error):","                completion(.failure(error))","            }","        }","    }","","    private func normalizeToE164(_ phone: String) -> String {","        let digits = phone.components(separatedBy: CharacterSet.decimalDigits.inverted).joined()","        return phone.hasPrefix(\"+\") ? \"+\\(digits)\" : \"+1\\(digits)\"","    }","","    private func extractCountryCode(from e164: String) -> String {","        \/\/ Extract country code from E.164 format","        guard e164.hasPrefix(\"+\") else { return \"\" }","        let countryCodeLength = e164.count > 12 ? 2 : (e164.count > 11 ? 1 : 1)","        return String(e164.dropFirst().prefix(countryCodeLength))","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/registerSmsNumber:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"registerSmsNumber:"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"registerSmsNumber:","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"registerSmsNumber:","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)registerSmsNumber:","symbolKind":"method"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/registersmsnumber:"]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Registers an SMS number for SMS messaging campaigns."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/registerSmsNumber:":{"abstract":[{"text":"Registers an SMS number for SMS messaging campaigns.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/registersmsnumber:","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/registerSmsNumber:","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"registerSmsNumber:","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"registerSmsNumber:","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"registerSmsNumber:","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"role":"symbol","title":"PWConfiguration","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","fragments":[{"text":"PWConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","type":"topic"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"type":"topic","title":"PushwooshCore","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore"}}}